  "description": "SwooshCat – A precision platformer starring an adorable feline! Master simple jumps and dashes to embark on a challenging yet delightful adventure. \n\nSlash, Parry, Break, Dodge – Your dash isn't just movement: it's a combat blade and puzzle key!\n\nExplore lush jungles and scorching deserts, each meticulously packed with deadly traps and cunning mechanisms to challenge your skills and strategy!\n\nTurn foes into stepping stones – Chain kills, parries, and dashes to bounce off corpses and bullets, resetting mobility to reach \"impossible\" corners!\n\nEasy to learn, deep to master: Newbies leap right in; speedrunners face brutal challenges!\n\nButtery controls + Rich level design = An unmissable catventure! ",
